# Plan R2/R3 (Cursor adapter)

Use for auth, migrations, dependencies, CI/CD, shared APIs/packages, architecture boundaries, credentials, production, or financial/healthcare-critical work.

1. Prefer Plan Mode before mutating; classify risk via `.safrs/policy.json` and `AGENTS.md`.
2. R2: designated review required — do not self-approve.
3. R3: prepare evidence/plan only; wait for explicit human authorization before execution.
4. Never deploy to production or merge a protected branch unless policy + human auth allow it.
5. Use isolated worktrees/environments for parallel mutation work. Create worktrees outside the repository root in the sibling directory `../Monorepo.worktrees/<branch-name>` (never inside `.worktrees/`).
